451: ## Edge Signal Quick Reference
452: 
453: Use these hints for common edge patterns:
454: 
455: | Pattern | Edge to create |
456: |---|---|
457: | React component renders another component in its JSX | `contains` from parent to child |
458: | Component/hook calls a custom hook (`useX`) | `depends_on` from consumer to hook file |
459: | Context provider wraps components | `exports` from provider to context definition |
460: | Component calls `useContext` or custom context hook | `depends_on` from consumer to context definition |
461: | Python file uses `from x import y` where x is a project file | `imports` edge (same rule as JS/TS) |
462: | Go file `import`s an internal package path | `imports` edge to the resolved file |
463: | Dockerfile COPY from code directory | `deploys` from Dockerfile to code entry point |
464: | docker-compose references Dockerfile | `depends_on` from compose to Dockerfile |
465: | CI config runs test commands | `triggers` from CI config to test files |
466: | SQL migration references table name | `migrates` from migration to table definition |
467: | GraphQL resolver imports from code | `defines_schema` from schema to resolver |
