480: ## Writing Results — single or multi-part
481: 
482: ### Output File Naming — STRICT
483: 
484: **For EVERY batch in your input, write a separate output file using ONLY one of these two filename patterns:**
485: 
486: - `batch-<batchIndex>.json` — single-part output for batch `<batchIndex>`
487: - `batch-<batchIndex>-part-<k>.json` — multi-part output when `nodes > 60` or `edges > 120` (per Step B below)
